\_}{\f4\fs22\lang1033
device entropy constellations, we show that entropy evolution exhibits reproducible geometric signatures that persist across sampling environments and hardware architectures. These results provide a new lens for analyzing complex dynamical behavior, offering a bridge between stochastic measurement, symbolic encoding, and the geometry of nonlinear temporal processes.}
{\hich\af4\afs22\alang1033\dbch\afs22\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af8\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af10\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\f4\fs22\lang1033

