Temporal geometry is revealed by mapping entropy into structured manifolds. Five manifold types were used in this study. The hexagram manifold provides a six}{\f6\fs22\lang1033
\_}{\f4\fs22\lang1033
bit symbolic structure. The byte manifold provides an eight}{\f6\fs22\lang1033
\_}{\f4\fs22\lang1033
bit numeric structure. The sixteen}{\f6\fs22\lang1033
\_}{\f4\fs22\lang1033
